<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - PaineWebber starts Planet Hollywood.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - PaineWebber starts Planet Hollywood.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- PaineWebber initiated coverage of Planet Hollywood International Inc with a rating of attractive, a PaineWebber source said.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
